      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## Search Scientific Illustration Prompts with Paper Banana\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow is manually triggered to search Paper Banana for scientific illustration prompts. It sets the desired search parameters, sends a GET request to the Paper Banana public API, then splits the returned prompt list into individual records and formats the key fields for downstream use.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure `category` and the optional `q` keyword in **Set Search Parameters**.\n- **Fetch Paper Banana Prompts** calls the public API; no credentials or authentication are required.\n- Run the workflow with **Test workflow** and use the structured items produced by **Build Prompt Records** in downstream tools.\n\n### Customization\n\nChange the category or query to search for different prompt types, or add more fields in **Build Prompt Records** if you need additional metadata from the API response.\n\n### Paper Banana resources\n\n- Prompt library: https://paperbanana.me/prompts\n- Public API: https://paperbanana.me/api/public/research-prompts\n- Website: https://paperbanana.me/"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
